# Self-referring, self-reflexive, self-consuming;  recursive
# Relating to the [[w:Ouroboros|Ouroboros]], a snake eating its own tail.
#: '''Examples'''
#:* "What could be more ouroboric than members of the media who specialize in blaming the media."
#:* "A simile is like a metaphor.", "I am lying"
#:* "Going back in time and killing one's grandfather is a rather ouroboric endeavour"

